# v10-D33.4 — Production environment overrides for API origin migration.
#
# When D33.5 (named cloudflared tunnel) lands and forge.echo-op.com /
# sdk.echo-op.com resolve to a real origin, uncomment one of the lines
# below to flip prod traffic off *.bmcii1976.workers.dev.
#
# Verification before uncommenting:
#   1. dig forge.echo-op.com  -> non-CF tunnel CNAME
#   2. curl -sI https://forge.echo-op.com/health  -> 200
#   3. Path mapping confirmed by D33.5 docs (worker subdomain == path prefix)
#
# Both vars are picked up by lib/api-base.ts. NEXT_PUBLIC_API_ORIGIN is the
# global override; per-channel vars take precedence when set.
#
# v10-D33.4b cutover (cc-builder-loop-hammer-637301, 2026-04-26):
# D33.5 + D33.5b complete (Caddy + ATT pinhole + 41 path-prefix worker routes
# on forge.echo-op.com/sdk.echo-op.com). Prod traffic now flows via the
# self-hosted reverse proxy instead of *.bmcii1976.workers.dev.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_ORIGIN=https://forge.echo-op.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORGE_ORIGIN=https://forge.echo-op.com
NEXT_PUBLIC_SDK_ORIGIN=https://sdk.echo-op.com
